/P 96 0 R
/E (Help students understand that while these simple rules do not always lead to the absolute best solution, they often help us make good decisions quickly. This mirrors how actual routing algorithms work - they use similar heuristics to balance finding a good route with computational efficiency.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
372 0 obj
<<
