/E (To extend the learning experience, consider creating a collaborative digital map marking the discovered routes, obstacles, and points of interest. The pupils could also analyze the environmental impact of different transport choices by calculating carbon footprints for each route, or explore how their routes might change during different seasons or weather conditions.)
