<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 90 0 R
/T (This is an excellent opportunity to explore how their different strategies emerged - whether they chose to handle balls in order of arrival, prioritized certain colors, or considered how close each ball was to its destination.)
/E (This is an excellent opportunity to explore how their different strategies emerged - whether they chose to handle balls in order of arrival, prioritized certain colors, or considered how close each ball was to its destination.)
/Pg 13 0 R
>>
endobj
589 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 90 0 R
/T (By making straightforward choices at each step - like passing to the nearest person in the right direction - they collectively created effective pathways through the network. This mirrors how actual routing algorithms work, breaking down complex networking challenges into manageable decisions that lead to efficient solutions.)
/E (By making straightforward choices at each step - like passing to the nearest person in the right direction - they collectively created effective pathways through the network. This mirrors how actual routing algorithms work, breaking down complex networking challenges into manageable decisions that lead to efficient solutions.)
/Pg 13 0 R
>>
endobj
